Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Consider separately whether the proposition holds or fails. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.

Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.

A detailed English derivation is pending.
